t manager, custodian, management/custody fee rates, and performance benchmark. Requires codes (.OF format) only; date is ignored.\\nFund codes must use the .OF suffix, e.g. '110011.OF,000001.OF'.\",\r\n              \"params\": [\r\n                {\r\n                  \"name\": \"query_type\",\r\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\r\n                  \"required\": true,\r\n                  \"description\": \"Query type: 'nav' (NAV snapshot) or 'info' (fund profile)\"\r\n                },\r\n                {\r\n                  \"name\": \"codes\",\r\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\r\n                  \"required\": true,\r\n                  \"description\": \"Fund codes, comma-separated, must use .OF suffix, e.g. '110011.OF,000001.OF' (max 50)\"\r\n                },\r\n                {\r\n                  \"name\": \"date\",\r\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\r\n                  \"required\": false,\r\n                  \"description\": \"Query date in YYYYMMDD or YYYY-MM-DD format. Required for query_type='nav'; ignored for query_type='info'.\"\r\n                }\r\n              ],\r\n              \"provider_description\": \"同花顺 (THS) iFinD data provider, offering financial data for Chinese and international markets including stocks, securities, funds, bonds, futures, etc. Supports company announcements, intelligent stock screening, industry analysis, market trend prediction, and more, helping users conduct comprehensive financial data analysis and investment decisions.\",\r\n              \"stats\": {\r\n                \"avg_execution_time_ms\": 433.15,\r\n                \"success_rate\": 0.894\r\n              },\r\n              \"expected_cost\": \"1 credits/result\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"tool_id\": \"mcp_gildata.shareholdingdetailreport.v1\",\r\n              \"name\": \"ShareholdingDetailReport\",\r\n              \"description\": \"基金持股明细\\n\\n获取基金持仓股票明细，包括市值、占比、行业等。\",\r\n             